# WARNING: contains production secrets — do not commit to public GitHub.
#
# Coolify → BACKEND service → Environment
#   General → Ports Exposes = 3005
#   Domain → backend.49.13.62.120.sslip.io
#
# Buildtime settings (critical for successful Docker build):
#   NIXPACKS_NODE_VERSION  → Buildtime ON  (optional but recommended)
#   Everything else below  → Buildtime OFF (Runtime only)
